1
00:01:43,700 --> 00:01:47,820
[KING OF COMEDY]

2
00:01:48,340 --> 00:01:50,950
[Episode 14]

3
00:02:03,350 --> 00:02:04,150
It's so good.

4
00:02:04,150 --> 00:02:05,280
And it's fresh, too.

5
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:06,790
The portion is big.

6
00:02:06,790 --> 00:02:07,840
And it tastes great.

7
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:08,870
You have a really good appetite.

8
00:02:08,870 --> 00:02:10,560
Thanks. You're doing pretty well yourself.

9
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:11,120
Thanks.

10
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:12,800
Do you think this one-yuan seafood

11
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:14,190
can make its money back?

12
00:02:14,190 --> 00:02:15,650
Won't they lose a fortune?

13
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:17,750
That's business warfare.

14
00:02:17,750 --> 00:02:19,300
Business warfare, you know.

15
00:02:19,300 --> 00:02:20,960
It's all part of the strategy.

16
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:23,840
They're just burning money

17
00:02:23,840 --> 00:02:25,770
to ruin us. They have deep pockets.

18
00:02:25,910 --> 00:02:27,570
How are we gonna counter that?

19
00:02:28,120 --> 00:02:30,380
We'll come back tomorrow, even earlier,

20
00:02:31,060 --> 00:02:32,030
with an empty stomach.

21
00:02:32,030 --> 00:02:33,470
We'll bring the whole village

22
00:02:33,470 --> 00:02:34,430
with an empty stomach.

23
00:02:34,430 --> 00:02:37,630
We'll eat till we get our money's worth
and bankrupt them!

24
00:02:37,700 --> 00:02:38,560
Check, please.

25
00:02:38,660 --> 00:02:41,230
Sir, may I see your room key card?

26
00:02:42,910 --> 00:02:43,680
What room card?

27
00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:45,470
Sir, only guests staying at our guesthouse

28
00:02:45,470 --> 00:02:47,670
can enjoy the one-yuan seafood buffet.

29
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:53,680
Hey, you never mentioned

30
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:55,150
that was a requirement.

31
00:02:55,829 --> 00:02:58,829
Sir, didn't you see the notice?

32
00:02:58,480 --> 00:03:00,050
[Stay at any hotel and show your key card
to enjoy a 1 yuan seafood buffet]

33
00:03:01,320 --> 00:03:03,120
I told you it wasn't that simple.

34
00:03:06,310 --> 00:03:08,030
What if we don't stay here?

35
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:10,360
If you don't stay here,

36
00:03:10,380 --> 00:03:11,240
you need to pay 3,800.

37
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:12,370
Scan the code to pay.

38
00:03:13,750 --> 00:03:14,990
Scan the code to pay.

39
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:20,710
This is private room one?

40
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:23,800
This isn't...

41
00:03:24,660 --> 00:03:25,630
very private.

42
00:03:26,630 --> 00:03:27,829
It's quite nice here.

43
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:29,360
It's nice and open.

44
00:03:29,630 --> 00:03:32,079
We don't have to worry
about anyone overhearing us.

45
00:03:32,079 --> 00:03:32,520
No.

46
00:03:33,240 --> 00:03:35,700
Aren't some things just awkward
to bring up?

47
00:03:35,870 --> 00:03:38,130
Then let's talk about something easier.

48
00:03:41,710 --> 00:03:44,310
Isn't this a souvenir sold
at the entrance of our village?

49
00:03:44,310 --> 00:03:45,120
Yes, I...

50
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:49,150
I... I just thought it was quite special.

51
00:03:49,150 --> 00:03:50,630
We don't have one in our village,

52
00:03:50,630 --> 00:03:52,829
so I bought one to put on display at home.

53
00:03:55,310 --> 00:03:56,120
Hua.

54
00:03:57,190 --> 00:03:58,120
Actually,

55
00:04:00,630 --> 00:04:01,710
right now... I'm

56
00:04:02,240 --> 00:04:03,710
the acting village chief.

57
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:04,710
I know.

58
00:04:05,470 --> 00:04:06,470
And someday,

59
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:09,780
I'll become the official village chief.

60
00:04:12,710 --> 00:04:14,170
You're the village chief.

61
00:04:14,430 --> 00:04:16,000
And I'll be the village chief, too.

62
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:17,510
You could say we're

63
00:04:18,190 --> 00:04:19,120
a good match for—

64
00:04:19,950 --> 00:04:21,560
Weren't you going to tell us

65
00:04:21,930 --> 00:04:25,000
how our two villages can develop together

66
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:26,130
and compete fairly?

67
00:04:31,430 --> 00:04:32,000
Yes.

68
00:04:33,270 --> 00:04:35,040
After an all-night meeting,

69
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:38,480
our village leadership

70
00:04:38,750 --> 00:04:39,240
decided

71
00:04:39,510 --> 00:04:40,710
that our two villages

72
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:42,750
will develop peacefully

73
00:04:42,750 --> 00:04:43,880
and compete fairly.

74
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:45,360
I wholeheartedly

75
00:04:46,830 --> 00:04:48,070
support that.

76
00:04:51,140 --> 00:04:52,000
Anything else?

77
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:54,200
That's it.

78
00:04:55,770 --> 00:04:56,630
Then I'll be going.

79
00:04:56,630 --> 00:04:58,120
No, no, no. There's more.

80
00:04:58,270 --> 00:04:59,150
There's more.

81
00:04:59,190 --> 00:05:00,830
That's just the first thing.

82
00:05:00,830 --> 00:05:02,290
T-There's a second thing.

83
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:03,600
Sit down first.

84
00:05:07,310 --> 00:05:08,000
Chief Fang.

85
00:05:09,190 --> 00:05:10,520
Thanks for getting someone to help

86
00:05:10,520 --> 00:05:12,040
fix our fishing boat.

87
00:05:12,280 --> 00:05:13,870
We can go out to sea tomorrow.

88
00:05:13,870 --> 00:05:15,680
Glad it's fixed. Stay safe.

89
00:05:15,740 --> 00:05:16,390
Will do.

90
00:05:16,390 --> 00:05:17,850
A good chief of the people.

91
00:05:18,950 --> 00:05:19,510
Hua.

92
00:05:20,040 --> 00:05:20,830
I wanted to discuss something—

93
00:05:20,830 --> 00:05:21,390
Mom.

94
00:05:22,630 --> 00:05:23,710
I forgot my keys.

95
00:05:24,750 --> 00:05:25,480
Oh, this kid.

96
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:27,680
Here, catch.

97
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:29,000
You've grown so much.

98
00:05:29,830 --> 00:05:30,920
Call him your big brother.

99
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:31,980
Just call me Uncle.

100
00:05:33,150 --> 00:05:33,950
Hello, Uncle.

101
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:37,720
Wait a minute.

102
00:05:41,409 --> 00:05:43,270
Uncle's got a little gift for you.

103
00:05:46,310 --> 00:05:47,440
Take it and have fun.

104
00:05:48,430 --> 00:05:49,430
Thank you, Uncle.

105
00:05:52,400 --> 00:05:54,000
She's pretty tall for her age.

106
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:55,800
She gets her height from her dad.

107
00:05:57,570 --> 00:06:03,450
♪ Memories are like endless rain ♪

108
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:03,040
Hua.

109
00:06:03,750 --> 00:06:04,870
The reason I came here this time...

110
00:06:04,040 --> 00:06:08,200
♪ I hold my umbrella,
but still get soaked ♪

111
00:06:05,390 --> 00:06:07,430
wasn't to talk about the village.

112
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:09,120
I want to talk about us.

113
00:06:08,580 --> 00:06:11,450
♪ Loving you without telling the world ♪

114
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:10,000
Can you stop?

115
00:06:11,550 --> 00:06:14,260
♪ It's funny, actually ♪

116
00:06:14,190 --> 00:06:15,750
No, I think...

117
00:06:14,690 --> 00:06:18,010
♪ At least at night,
I have these thoughts ♪

118
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:17,800
Ms. Li.

119
00:06:18,040 --> 00:06:21,160
♪ To keep me company in the silence ♪

120
00:06:18,430 --> 00:06:21,160
Did you get your broken pot fixed?

121
00:06:21,430 --> 00:06:22,190
It's fixed.

122
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:23,560
It's fixed?

123
00:06:23,990 --> 00:06:30,130
♪ I was just a little short on luck ♪

124
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:29,040
Should we now...

125
00:06:29,040 --> 00:06:29,630
Mr. Li.

126
00:06:30,070 --> 00:06:31,950
Didn't you say your door was broken?

127
00:06:30,510 --> 00:06:33,550
♪ But that's okay, I'm still learning ♪

128
00:06:32,040 --> 00:06:32,950
How is it now?

129
00:06:33,710 --> 00:06:36,670
♪ I've tamed love before ♪

130
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:35,750
Mr. Jiang.

131
00:06:35,750 --> 00:06:36,750
Can you listen to me?

132
00:06:36,750 --> 00:06:38,190
Don't say it. I don't want to hear it.

133
00:06:36,860 --> 00:06:41,260
♪ Yet I still can't accept
becoming a stranger to you ♪

134
00:06:38,190 --> 00:06:39,120
I have to say!

135
00:06:42,180 --> 00:06:47,520
♪ I could wait a century for you ♪

136
00:06:43,070 --> 00:06:45,070
I don't care what others think of me.

137
00:06:46,480 --> 00:06:48,190
I worked so hard to become village chief

138
00:06:48,190 --> 00:06:49,360
just so I'd be good enough for you.

139
00:06:48,260 --> 00:06:50,690
♪ The longest dream I've ever had ♪

140
00:06:50,710 --> 00:06:54,200
♪ Is loving you
while hiding it from the world ♪

141
00:06:51,270 --> 00:06:52,930
I hope you can give me a chance.

142
00:06:54,490 --> 00:06:58,690
♪ Sharing this secret only with myself ♪

143
00:06:54,750 --> 00:06:55,560
I like you.

144
00:06:59,159 --> 00:07:02,050
♪ It's because I'm not smart ♪

145
00:06:59,360 --> 00:07:00,490
I want to be with you.

146
00:07:02,410 --> 00:07:05,860
♪ And don't know how to deduce ♪

147
00:07:06,330 --> 00:07:12,980
♪ Figuring out the hidden meaning
when it's too late ♪

148
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:12,820
Chief Fang.

149
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:17,240
Nothing. Nothing.

150
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:17,840
It's fine.

151
00:07:18,070 --> 00:07:19,230
Just tell me if there's something.

152
00:07:19,230 --> 00:07:19,960
Nothing.

153
00:07:20,270 --> 00:07:21,360
Come up and tell me.

154
00:07:23,270 --> 00:07:23,870
Alright.

155
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:26,390
Go up.

156
00:07:27,470 --> 00:07:33,610
♪ I was just a little short on luck ♪

157
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:33,990
-What is it?
-Chief Fang?

158
00:07:33,990 --> 00:07:37,920
♪ But that's okay, I'm still learning ♪

159
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:35,510
Nothing.

160
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:37,680
Nothing, really.

161
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:38,120
Nothing?

162
00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:40,000
Then why do you have that contract?

163
00:07:38,470 --> 00:07:41,430
♪ I've tamed love before ♪

164
00:07:41,270 --> 00:07:41,920
This is the document

165
00:07:41,620 --> 00:07:46,020
♪ Yet I still can't accept
becoming a stranger to you ♪

166
00:07:41,920 --> 00:07:43,650
from our last village meeting.

167
00:07:44,060 --> 00:07:45,720
Then let me take another look.

168
00:07:45,870 --> 00:07:46,720
You already signed it.

169
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:49,470
♪ Our fate ends here ♪

170
00:07:47,310 --> 00:07:49,510
Let me take another look. You signed it.

171
00:07:49,590 --> 00:07:55,500
♪ Slowly scattering into the sky ♪

172
00:07:56,190 --> 00:07:57,720
How many times have I told you?

173
00:07:57,720 --> 00:07:59,240
Whatever Fang Hua says,

174
00:07:59,240 --> 00:08:00,970
we have to stick to our own plan.

175
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:03,600
Is the room key card with you?

176
00:08:04,830 --> 00:08:07,520
Great. Give me a key card for Room 207.

177
00:08:07,610 --> 00:08:08,810
Please wait a moment.

178
00:08:10,070 --> 00:08:11,720
Okay, I got it. All right.

179
00:08:11,950 --> 00:08:13,810
Okay, I'll come out now, alright?

180
00:08:16,100 --> 00:08:18,000
Is she the one who's always
at odds with our chief?

181
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:18,930
Yes, that's her.

182
00:08:19,560 --> 00:08:20,310
It's fine. Let's eat together.

183
00:08:20,310 --> 00:08:21,510
We've already eaten.

184
00:08:22,070 --> 00:08:23,430
Okay, we're leaving then.

185
00:08:23,430 --> 00:08:24,120
-We're leaving.
-Okay.

186
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:24,650
Bye-bye.

187
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:25,750
We're off.

188
00:08:25,750 --> 00:08:27,390
Bye-bye.

189
00:08:37,909 --> 00:08:39,360
Hua, what is that place?

190
00:08:39,820 --> 00:08:42,220
That's the best guesthouse in our village.

191
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:44,080
Big jerk.

192
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:46,970
-What's wrong?
-Zhou Ke, you bastard!

193
00:08:49,910 --> 00:08:50,960
What did you see?

194
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:54,060
Your room card.

195
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:57,270
Are you sure this is the cheapest option?

196
00:08:57,270 --> 00:08:57,870
I'm sure.

197
00:08:57,910 --> 00:08:58,370
Really?

198
00:08:58,600 --> 00:08:59,080
Really.

199
00:08:59,270 --> 00:09:00,730
There's nothing cheaper?

200
00:09:00,750 --> 00:09:01,550
Trust me.

201
00:09:08,720 --> 00:09:09,850
It still costs a lot.

202
00:09:09,910 --> 00:09:11,370
Alright, let's check out.

203
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:13,040
Hello, I'd like to check out.

204
00:09:13,110 --> 00:09:15,600
Don't check out. We're already here.

205
00:09:18,550 --> 00:09:20,080
That should be everything—

206
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:23,150
toothpaste, toothbrushes,
toilet paper, and slippers.

207
00:09:23,150 --> 00:09:24,320
Their shampoo

208
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:25,200
isn't disposable.

209
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:26,260
I'll put it in here.

210
00:09:26,320 --> 00:09:27,150
Body wash, shampoo, conditioner—

211
00:09:27,150 --> 00:09:27,870
Well done.

212
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:30,720
I'll take these bottles of water.

213
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:31,600
Go check the balcony

214
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:33,830
to see if there are
any disposable ashtrays.

215
00:09:33,830 --> 00:09:35,890
Since when are ashtrays disposable?

216
00:09:41,360 --> 00:09:42,390
Come here.

217
00:09:42,790 --> 00:09:43,920
There really is one?

218
00:09:48,870 --> 00:09:49,800
What's going on?

219
00:09:49,960 --> 00:09:50,690
I don't know.

220
00:09:52,380 --> 00:09:53,670
This is bad. It's over.

221
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:56,050
Didn't Jiahao swear they'd broken up?

222
00:09:56,050 --> 00:09:57,150
Their romance is back on.

223
00:09:57,150 --> 00:09:57,980
That's dating.

224
00:09:57,980 --> 00:09:59,360
What's the situation now?

225
00:09:59,360 --> 00:10:00,410
Our two villages are at war.

226
00:10:00,410 --> 00:10:01,790
And this is how the two village chiefs
are behaving?

227
00:10:01,790 --> 00:10:03,910
Besides, Jiahao is a bit
of a hopeless romantic.

228
00:10:03,910 --> 00:10:05,630
What if love clouds his judgment

229
00:10:05,630 --> 00:10:06,390
and he switches sides?

230
00:10:06,390 --> 00:10:07,840
He isn't like that.

231
00:10:07,870 --> 00:10:09,120
What if we're fighting
on the front lines here

232
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:10,390
while he takes us down from within?

233
00:10:10,390 --> 00:10:12,120
Let's go confront him right now

234
00:10:12,150 --> 00:10:13,610
and catch him red-handed.

235
00:10:15,480 --> 00:10:16,340
Let me tell you.

236
00:10:16,720 --> 00:10:18,320
-Who are you looking for?
-Where are they?

237
00:10:18,320 --> 00:10:19,120
-Who?
-Who?

238
00:10:19,270 --> 00:10:20,330
That man and woman!

239
00:10:21,440 --> 00:10:22,480
Don't be impulsive,

240
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:23,240
Chief Fang.

241
00:10:25,790 --> 00:10:27,050
Which room are they in?

242
00:10:27,750 --> 00:10:29,600
Give me a room card for 207.

243
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:30,720
Okay, please wait a moment.

244
00:10:30,720 --> 00:10:32,390
Okay, I got it. Alright.

245
00:10:32,770 --> 00:10:34,150
207. 207.

246
00:10:37,630 --> 00:10:38,690
I'll go take a look.

247
00:10:39,390 --> 00:10:40,390
Don't mention it.

248
00:10:41,690 --> 00:10:42,360
It's over.

249
00:10:43,140 --> 00:10:44,210
This guy

250
00:10:44,240 --> 00:10:47,300
is here to stand up for Ma Feiyan
on behalf of Chief Fang.

251
00:10:47,630 --> 00:10:48,480
Hurry up.

252
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:50,600
Why are you going
to the bathroom at a time like this?

253
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:51,270
I'm coming.

254
00:10:53,030 --> 00:10:53,690
I'm coming.

255
00:11:02,830 --> 00:11:03,550
Jiahao.

256
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:05,320
Jiahao. Jiahao.

257
00:11:05,320 --> 00:11:06,120
Don't drag me.

258
00:11:07,150 --> 00:11:08,080
You went too far.

259
00:11:08,430 --> 00:11:09,760
This is the third floor.

260
00:11:14,750 --> 00:11:17,010
Why did it go back down
to the first floor?

261
00:11:17,040 --> 00:11:19,450
Excuse me, which room
are the man and woman

262
00:11:19,480 --> 00:11:20,540
who just walked in?

263
00:11:20,670 --> 00:11:21,150
Who?

264
00:11:22,940 --> 00:11:24,070
Your village chief.

265
00:11:24,510 --> 00:11:25,640
We are good friends.

266
00:11:25,870 --> 00:11:27,240
I need to see her about something.

267
00:11:27,240 --> 00:11:28,910
2... 207.

268
00:11:28,910 --> 00:11:29,500
Thank you.

269
00:11:29,500 --> 00:11:30,030
Let's go.

270
00:11:31,270 --> 00:11:33,390
Isn't that guy from Shapu Village?

271
00:11:33,720 --> 00:11:36,320
Looks like they're really
going all out against Ms. Ma.

272
00:11:36,320 --> 00:11:39,580
She's even teaming up
with other villages to take her down.

273
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:41,440
Please help open the door.

274
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:43,440
Don't worry, I won't tell anyone.

275
00:11:52,870 --> 00:11:54,120
What if they came to our village

276
00:11:54,120 --> 00:11:55,920
to learn from our guesthouse...

277
00:11:58,030 --> 00:11:59,430
management techniques?

278
00:11:59,600 --> 00:12:01,130
They sure are experienced.

279
00:12:02,790 --> 00:12:05,030
It's obviously not their first time.

280
00:12:07,840 --> 00:12:09,120
Pink lights.

281
00:12:09,550 --> 00:12:10,480
Swans.

282
00:12:11,080 --> 00:12:12,320
And petals.

283
00:12:14,390 --> 00:12:15,080
This girl

284
00:12:15,670 --> 00:12:17,510
usually doesn't even
wash her face at home.

285
00:12:17,510 --> 00:12:19,610
I'm the one who braids her hair every day.

286
00:12:19,610 --> 00:12:21,420
She even put on lipstick for him.

287
00:12:21,790 --> 00:12:22,720
This is mascara.

288
00:12:25,440 --> 00:12:27,840
She was completely fooled
by this Zhou guy.

289
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:30,290
I'm going to wait right here
for him today.

290
00:12:33,960 --> 00:12:35,270
Let's get out of here.

291
00:12:35,790 --> 00:12:36,630
Didn't you see the look

292
00:12:36,630 --> 00:12:38,480
in that waitress's eyes just now?

293
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:40,010
What if she misunderstands

294
00:12:40,240 --> 00:12:41,170
and thinks we...

295
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:43,150
If this gets out,

296
00:12:43,560 --> 00:12:45,560
how can I stay in this village?

297
00:12:46,510 --> 00:12:47,710
You just reminded me.

298
00:12:48,960 --> 00:12:50,790
That Zhou guy is a piece of work.

299
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:52,720
When he comes in later

300
00:12:52,720 --> 00:12:53,870
and sees us sitting here,

301
00:12:53,870 --> 00:12:55,030
he might turn the tables on us.

302
00:12:55,030 --> 00:12:55,550
Yeah.

303
00:12:55,960 --> 00:12:56,760
You're right.

304
00:12:57,080 --> 00:12:57,480
Let's go.

305
00:12:57,480 --> 00:12:58,280
I have to hide.

306
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:00,530
I'll catch him red-handed.

307
00:13:07,910 --> 00:13:08,840
Come on, come on.

308
00:13:09,140 --> 00:13:09,740
Come here.

309
00:13:23,720 --> 00:13:25,150
They didn't even close the door.

310
00:13:25,150 --> 00:13:26,630
What if Jiahao came to learn

311
00:13:26,630 --> 00:13:28,690
guesthouse management techniques?

312
00:13:31,960 --> 00:13:33,490
They sure are experienced.

313
00:13:34,120 --> 00:13:35,600
These pink lights.

314
00:13:36,200 --> 00:13:37,030
Swans.

315
00:13:37,670 --> 00:13:38,510
And petals.

316
00:13:38,770 --> 00:13:40,080
They're practically
living together in here.

317
00:13:40,080 --> 00:13:40,740
This is their secret base.

318
00:13:40,740 --> 00:13:42,020
Look, his pen was left here.

319
00:13:42,020 --> 00:13:43,110
This is lipstick.

320
00:13:43,360 --> 00:13:44,290
This is mascara.

321
00:13:51,390 --> 00:13:53,270
I always thought Jiahao
was quite innocent.

322
00:13:53,270 --> 00:13:53,870
Really.

323
00:13:54,150 --> 00:13:56,080
No, why am I hiding here with you?

324
00:13:59,270 --> 00:14:00,270
Just wait for him.

325
00:14:00,480 --> 00:14:02,340
Jiahao isn't that kind of person.

326
00:14:03,270 --> 00:14:04,600
You underestimate him.

327
00:14:05,390 --> 00:14:07,150
He hides it too well.

328
00:14:07,170 --> 00:14:08,410
It's really scary.

329
00:14:08,870 --> 00:14:11,270
Don't you think you're overstepping a bit?

330
00:14:11,470 --> 00:14:12,520
I'm her brother.

331
00:14:13,030 --> 00:14:15,230
They are free to love whoever they want.

332
00:14:16,270 --> 00:14:18,530
Then why can't we freely love each other?

333
00:14:20,750 --> 00:14:23,350
I seriously suspect
he defected a long time ago

334
00:14:23,630 --> 00:14:24,870
and became an undercover agent
for the enemy.

335
00:14:24,870 --> 00:14:25,800
Look, recently,

336
00:14:25,840 --> 00:14:26,620
whatever our village does,

337
00:14:26,620 --> 00:14:27,910
their village just directly copies.

338
00:14:27,910 --> 00:14:28,720
I don't even dare to think about it.

339
00:14:28,720 --> 00:14:29,780
It's really scary.

340
00:14:30,080 --> 00:14:33,080
No, if he hides it so well

341
00:14:33,390 --> 00:14:34,320
and is so capable,

342
00:14:34,320 --> 00:14:34,870
if he comes back

343
00:14:34,870 --> 00:14:35,910
and sees us,

344
00:14:35,910 --> 00:14:37,750
he might turn around
and accuse us of having a thing going on.

345
00:14:37,750 --> 00:14:38,440
Let's hide

346
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:39,260
and catch him red-handed.

347
00:14:39,260 --> 00:14:40,320
Let's go. Let's go.

348
00:14:41,240 --> 00:14:41,670
No.

349
00:14:42,320 --> 00:14:43,240
Here, here.
He'll never think to look here.

350
00:14:43,240 --> 00:14:44,300
Let's go. Let's go.

351
00:14:45,120 --> 00:14:45,600
Come on.

352
00:14:48,150 --> 00:14:48,680
Hurry up.

353
00:14:54,870 --> 00:14:55,720
Wait a minute.

354
00:14:57,120 --> 00:14:58,520
Did you prepare all this?

355
00:15:00,120 --> 00:15:01,720
There's a surprise inside.

356
00:15:03,570 --> 00:15:04,900
I'll change my clothes.

357
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:05,660
Wait for me.

358
00:15:07,030 --> 00:15:07,720
Then you can wait alone.

359
00:15:07,720 --> 00:15:08,480
I'm leaving.

360
00:15:08,750 --> 00:15:09,550
Don't, don't.

361
00:15:09,720 --> 00:15:10,780
What are you doing?

362
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:11,370
Let's...

363
00:15:13,690 --> 00:15:15,050
Let's play some music.

364
00:15:16,120 --> 00:15:16,580
Come on.

365
00:15:35,360 --> 00:15:36,390
Darling.

366
00:15:36,960 --> 00:15:37,890
I put the gift...

367
00:15:38,080 --> 00:15:40,320
I put the surprise on the bed for you.

368
00:15:47,080 --> 00:15:47,880
What the hell?

369
00:15:50,440 --> 00:15:51,300
Don't touch me.

370
00:15:53,190 --> 00:15:54,550
I won't move. I won't move.

371
00:15:54,550 --> 00:15:55,670
Hurry up and go.

372
00:15:58,840 --> 00:15:59,640
What's wrong?

373
00:16:00,030 --> 00:16:02,030
Hubby, why aren't you answering me?

374
00:16:03,200 --> 00:16:04,320
Hubby.

375
00:16:06,720 --> 00:16:07,780
What are you doing?

376
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:09,550
This room is haunted.

377
00:16:10,080 --> 00:16:10,510
What?

378
00:16:11,670 --> 00:16:13,000
More than one spirit is here.

379
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:14,200
It's fine.

380
00:16:14,200 --> 00:16:14,790
It's not fine.

381
00:16:14,790 --> 00:16:15,600
It's not fine. Hurry up and go.

382
00:16:15,600 --> 00:16:16,390
There's a problem in this room.

383
00:16:16,390 --> 00:16:17,200
-Where to?
-Let's go.

384
00:16:17,200 --> 00:16:17,720
Where to?

385
00:16:17,720 --> 00:16:18,390
Hurry up. Let's go.

386
00:16:18,390 --> 00:16:19,080
Let's go. Let's go.

387
00:16:19,080 --> 00:16:20,080
Hurry up. Get out.

388
00:16:20,270 --> 00:16:21,720
Hurry up.

389
00:16:41,390 --> 00:16:42,270
Ke!

390
00:16:42,600 --> 00:16:43,390
Ke.

391
00:16:43,630 --> 00:16:44,480
-What happened?
-Something went wrong.

392
00:16:44,480 --> 00:16:45,790
What took you guys so long?

393
00:16:45,790 --> 00:16:47,630
-Look at this video.
-What's going on?

394
00:16:47,630 --> 00:16:49,320
It's all over the internet now.

395
00:16:49,320 --> 00:16:51,000
You've been exposed. Look.

396
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:52,150
Wait, wait, wait. Let me see.

397
00:16:52,150 --> 00:16:53,270
Come and take a look, all of you.

398
00:16:53,270 --> 00:16:53,870
What is it?

399
00:16:54,630 --> 00:16:55,690
Look at this title.

400
00:16:56,270 --> 00:16:58,270
Even the Fishball Beauty loves

401
00:16:58,270 --> 00:17:00,080
our Chuanao seafood.

402
00:17:01,550 --> 00:17:02,950
What were you three up to?

403
00:17:03,120 --> 00:17:05,109
You went to Chuanao to gorge on seafood?

404
00:17:05,109 --> 00:17:05,510
No, no.

405
00:17:05,510 --> 00:17:06,310
We didn't expect it.

406
00:17:06,310 --> 00:17:07,460
We were really careful
to cover ourselves up.

407
00:17:07,460 --> 00:17:08,170
-You covered yourselves up?
-They still got a picture

408
00:17:08,170 --> 00:17:08,880
even though we covered up so well?

409
00:17:08,880 --> 00:17:09,960
Look at you,

410
00:17:09,960 --> 00:17:12,200
stuffing your faces like that.

411
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:13,920
It was all caught on camera.

412
00:17:13,920 --> 00:17:15,480
Doesn't that just show
she's popular lately?

413
00:17:15,480 --> 00:17:15,920
Don't ask.

414
00:17:15,920 --> 00:17:16,589
You have no idea

415
00:17:16,589 --> 00:17:17,510
what we went through tonight.

416
00:17:17,510 --> 00:17:19,109
You didn't even bring me any.

417
00:17:19,160 --> 00:17:20,109
Was it good?

418
00:17:21,589 --> 00:17:22,680
Did they have boiled shrimp?

419
00:17:22,680 --> 00:17:23,109
Zhen.

420
00:17:29,350 --> 00:17:30,030
Bingqiang.

421
00:17:30,590 --> 00:17:31,270
Bingqiang?

422
00:17:40,310 --> 00:17:41,680
That's great.

423
00:17:41,830 --> 00:17:42,680
Coming back this time,

424
00:17:42,680 --> 00:17:45,000
I found that Shapu Village
has changed so much.

425
00:17:45,000 --> 00:17:45,510
Right?

426
00:17:45,750 --> 00:17:46,350
Before I left,

427
00:17:46,350 --> 00:17:48,350
I remember this place was destroyed

428
00:17:48,680 --> 00:17:49,720
by that typhoon, wasn't it?

429
00:17:49,720 --> 00:17:50,240
Yeah.

430
00:17:50,640 --> 00:17:52,480
So, Zhen, you built

431
00:17:52,500 --> 00:17:53,960
Shapu into what it is today
all by yourself?

432
00:17:53,960 --> 00:17:54,890
You're amazing.

433
00:17:55,550 --> 00:17:56,960
It wasn't just me.

434
00:17:57,440 --> 00:17:58,240
Jiahao and Mr. Zhou

435
00:17:58,240 --> 00:17:59,110
also contributed a lot.

436
00:17:59,110 --> 00:18:00,240
Right, Mr. Zhou.

437
00:18:00,680 --> 00:18:01,200
Mr. Zhou.

438
00:18:01,200 --> 00:18:01,680
Mr. Zhou.

439
00:18:01,680 --> 00:18:02,270
Mr. Zhou.

440
00:18:04,030 --> 00:18:04,430
Hello.

441
00:18:04,550 --> 00:18:06,150
Go on, go show him who's boss.

442
00:18:06,640 --> 00:18:07,160
Hello.

443
00:18:08,160 --> 00:18:09,220
Bingqiang, right?

444
00:18:09,640 --> 00:18:10,290
I'm Zhou Ke.

445
00:18:10,290 --> 00:18:10,860
Hello.

446
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:15,680
Let's go back and sit down to talk.

447
00:18:15,680 --> 00:18:16,030
Let's go.

448
00:18:16,030 --> 00:18:16,550
Right.

449
00:18:16,590 --> 00:18:17,880
Let's sit here to talk.

450
00:18:17,880 --> 00:18:19,480
-Come back, Ke.
-Let me do it.

451
00:18:19,480 --> 00:18:21,400
Alright, come back quickly, Ke.

452
00:18:21,500 --> 00:18:21,830
Okay.

453
00:18:21,830 --> 00:18:22,680
Let's sit down and chat.

454
00:18:22,680 --> 00:18:23,400
Bingqiang.

455
00:18:23,880 --> 00:18:26,000
I saw your Moments.

456
00:18:26,310 --> 00:18:28,640
Your location was still
showing Dubai yesterday.

457
00:18:28,640 --> 00:18:30,040
Why are you back already?

458
00:18:30,830 --> 00:18:33,000
How did he see it?

459
00:18:33,200 --> 00:18:35,430
Aren't Moments meant to be seen by others?

460
00:18:35,430 --> 00:18:38,190
It's really embarrassing to talk about.

461
00:18:38,270 --> 00:18:39,070
Well, this time,

462
00:18:39,070 --> 00:18:41,750
I was in a hurry to return to China,
so I wanted to fly straight home.

463
00:18:41,750 --> 00:18:43,200
But my secretary got the dates mixed up

464
00:18:43,200 --> 00:18:45,200
for my camping trip with Mr. Wang.

465
00:18:45,200 --> 00:18:45,860
Secretary?

466
00:18:46,030 --> 00:18:47,200
Then I figured

467
00:18:47,200 --> 00:18:48,830
we'd meet somewhere in between

468
00:18:48,830 --> 00:18:50,240
for a quick meeting,

469
00:18:50,240 --> 00:18:51,500
so we settled on Dubai.

470
00:18:51,590 --> 00:18:52,830
I thought it was good, though.

471
00:18:52,830 --> 00:18:54,200
I could stop by Chanel there

472
00:18:54,200 --> 00:18:55,400
and buy a bag for you.

473
00:18:55,680 --> 00:18:56,540
No, no, no need.

474
00:18:56,590 --> 00:18:58,750
That unfamiliar sales guy
was really not okay.

475
00:18:58,750 --> 00:18:59,790
You should've reached out to me.

476
00:18:59,790 --> 00:19:01,550
I've got connections there, too.

477
00:19:01,550 --> 00:19:03,080
So I didn't end up buying it.

478
00:19:04,270 --> 00:19:06,830
I was thinking I'd take you
all to Dubai next time.

479
00:19:06,830 --> 00:19:07,760
What's the word?

480
00:19:08,000 --> 00:19:09,270
To check in, right?

481
00:19:09,270 --> 00:19:10,750
Yes, yes, yes.

482
00:19:11,200 --> 00:19:12,240
Take us all there, right?

483
00:19:12,240 --> 00:19:13,840
That's great. That's great.

484
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:15,160
No one gets my jokes

485
00:19:15,160 --> 00:19:16,110
in that giant French village.

486
00:19:16,110 --> 00:19:17,790
I was really lonely there.

487
00:19:17,790 --> 00:19:19,270
Look at Bingqiang's perspective.

488
00:19:19,270 --> 00:19:20,880
He's different from before.

489
00:19:21,590 --> 00:19:23,720
He's nothing like
he was when we were kids.

490
00:19:23,720 --> 00:19:24,400
Not at all.

491
00:19:25,000 --> 00:19:26,440
Then why did you

492
00:19:26,440 --> 00:19:27,840
come back empty-handed?

493
00:19:27,960 --> 00:19:29,490
You didn't bring anything.

494
00:19:29,960 --> 00:19:30,550
Traveling is tiring.

495
00:19:30,550 --> 00:19:31,590
Well, I didn't come back
completely empty-handed.

496
00:19:31,590 --> 00:19:32,920
Good thing I had plan B.

497
00:19:33,790 --> 00:19:35,000
This is for you.

498
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:37,920
What is this?

499
00:19:38,440 --> 00:19:40,030
Is this a car ashtray?

500
00:19:40,030 --> 00:19:40,640
Open it.

501
00:19:47,510 --> 00:19:48,270
What is it?

502
00:19:48,440 --> 00:19:49,480
Look, Jiahao.

503
00:19:49,480 --> 00:19:50,640
This is so beautiful.

504
00:19:50,640 --> 00:19:50,970
Look.

505
00:19:54,830 --> 00:19:55,960
It's so beautiful.

506
00:19:56,270 --> 00:19:59,070
Bingqiang, you're still the same
as when we were kids.

507
00:19:59,070 --> 00:20:00,200
It's so sweet

508
00:20:00,550 --> 00:20:02,640
of you
to think of me from so far away.

509
00:20:02,790 --> 00:20:05,720
A gift like this doesn't even need a box.

510
00:20:06,110 --> 00:20:08,370
Of course, it's the thought that counts.

511
00:20:08,550 --> 00:20:09,440
I-I can understand.

512
00:20:09,440 --> 00:20:11,170
At least he put thought into it.

513
00:20:11,880 --> 00:20:13,510
This pearl really isn't worth much.

514
00:20:13,510 --> 00:20:14,750
See? It's not worth much.

515
00:20:14,750 --> 00:20:17,440
But it's from the clam

516
00:20:17,790 --> 00:20:20,240
Zhen gave me before I went abroad.

517
00:20:25,400 --> 00:20:27,120
All these years I've been abroad,

518
00:20:27,120 --> 00:20:28,650
this pearl has been with me.

519
00:20:30,030 --> 00:20:31,750
Whenever I ran into trouble

520
00:20:31,750 --> 00:20:33,630
or felt like I couldn't
get past something,

521
00:20:33,630 --> 00:20:35,180
I would talk to this pearl.

522
00:20:35,510 --> 00:20:38,350
It felt like Zhen was right here with me.

523
00:20:39,070 --> 00:20:40,550
Actually, it was when I opened that clam

524
00:20:40,550 --> 00:20:41,590
that I realized

525
00:20:42,030 --> 00:20:44,160
you aren't

526
00:20:44,640 --> 00:20:46,440
the only pearl in Shapu Village.

527
00:20:48,070 --> 00:20:50,030
Then you came back at the perfect time.

528
00:20:50,030 --> 00:20:51,920
Now Shapu has three pearls.

529
00:20:51,920 --> 00:20:53,030
I'm here too.

530
00:20:54,440 --> 00:20:55,900
And you, our pearl, are...

531
00:20:57,830 --> 00:21:00,030
Let me formally introduce myself.

532
00:21:00,400 --> 00:21:02,790
I am Mr. Zhou Ke's cousin

533
00:21:03,030 --> 00:21:04,640
and his agent.

534
00:21:04,680 --> 00:21:07,960
Our schedule is always packed, too.

535
00:21:07,960 --> 00:21:10,200
We're always flying here and there

536
00:21:10,200 --> 00:21:12,310
and often based in Shudian.

537
00:21:12,920 --> 00:21:14,920
And we always...

538
00:21:15,270 --> 00:21:16,200
That's about it.

539
00:21:17,310 --> 00:21:18,590
Well, Bingqiang,

540
00:21:18,590 --> 00:21:20,960
are you hungry
after coming back from Dubai?

541
00:21:20,960 --> 00:21:22,880
How about I have Zhen
cook some fish balls for you?

542
00:21:22,880 --> 00:21:23,310
Yeah.

543
00:21:23,310 --> 00:21:23,960
No need.

544
00:21:23,960 --> 00:21:26,240
A little hunger keeps me driven.

545
00:21:28,070 --> 00:21:29,640
Besides, I couldn't possibly trouble you

546
00:21:29,640 --> 00:21:30,240
this late.

547
00:21:30,440 --> 00:21:32,240
It's no trouble.
He's always been so driven.

548
00:21:32,240 --> 00:21:34,640
He still expects so much of himself.

549
00:21:35,240 --> 00:21:36,920
W-Where are you staying
now that you're back?

550
00:21:36,920 --> 00:21:38,880
I'll just stay at our old house.

551
00:21:39,270 --> 00:21:40,330
How can you do that?

552
00:21:40,480 --> 00:21:42,810
Your house hasn't been lived in for years.

553
00:21:43,000 --> 00:21:43,750
How can you stay there?

554
00:21:43,750 --> 00:21:45,210
Y-You can stay at my place.

555
00:21:45,960 --> 00:21:46,400
No.

556
00:21:46,880 --> 00:21:48,680
Our place is hardly fit for a guest.

557
00:21:48,680 --> 00:21:50,830
How can we let Bingqiang suffer
by staying with us?

558
00:21:50,830 --> 00:21:52,200
Indeed, our house...

559
00:21:52,880 --> 00:21:54,880
I'll arrange a place for you to stay.

560
00:21:56,510 --> 00:21:57,570
I'll listen to you.

561
00:21:58,480 --> 00:21:59,030
Let's go.

562
00:21:59,590 --> 00:22:00,510
I'll head over first.

563
00:22:00,510 --> 00:22:00,920
Okay.

564
00:22:01,160 --> 00:22:01,690
Alright.

565
00:22:02,400 --> 00:22:03,260
We're leaving.

566
00:22:04,470 --> 00:22:07,400
Look at them. They've been
so close since childhood.

567
00:22:07,790 --> 00:22:09,550
Since when have they been

568
00:22:09,550 --> 00:22:11,070
linking arms like that?

569
00:22:12,160 --> 00:22:13,890
Someone asked me out for a meal.

570
00:22:13,920 --> 00:22:14,750
I have to go eat.

571
00:22:14,750 --> 00:22:16,310
I don't need to stay sharp, hungry,

572
00:22:16,310 --> 00:22:17,830
driven, or whatever.

573
00:22:17,830 --> 00:22:18,590
I'm leaving.

574
00:22:18,790 --> 00:22:19,990
You're leaving, too?

575
00:22:20,590 --> 00:22:23,920
Everyone is pairing up.

576
00:22:26,830 --> 00:22:28,090
I'll keep you company.

577
00:22:35,160 --> 00:22:39,070
You and Bingqiang seem pretty close.

578
00:22:39,510 --> 00:22:40,200
It seems

579
00:22:40,720 --> 00:22:42,510
Zhen is quite warm towards him.

580
00:22:43,160 --> 00:22:44,720
The three of us

581
00:22:46,200 --> 00:22:47,480
grew up together.

582
00:22:54,270 --> 00:22:55,660
Hello, Junnan.

583
00:22:56,680 --> 00:22:57,510
What are you doing?

584
00:22:57,120 --> 00:22:58,030
[Young Chen Junnan]

585
00:22:58,240 --> 00:22:59,550
I'm building a sandcastle.

586
00:22:59,550 --> 00:23:00,720
Take that!

587
00:23:00,720 --> 00:23:01,780
What are you doing?

588
00:23:02,830 --> 00:23:03,510
I want

589
00:23:03,680 --> 00:23:04,270
to bully

590
00:23:04,270 --> 00:23:05,030
you.

591
00:23:05,750 --> 00:23:06,540
Let him go!

592
00:23:07,510 --> 00:23:08,200
Let him go!

593
00:23:09,550 --> 00:23:11,240
Zhen, I missed you.

594
00:23:11,240 --> 00:23:12,040
Get lost!

595
00:23:16,790 --> 00:23:19,920
So, that little girl is Zhen.

596
00:23:20,830 --> 00:23:23,360
The little boy
who was rescued was Bingqiang?

597
00:23:25,070 --> 00:23:26,730
The rescued little boy was me.

598
00:23:27,960 --> 00:23:29,440
Bingqiang stood

599
00:23:30,270 --> 00:23:31,400
next to Chen Junnan.

600
00:23:32,220 --> 00:23:34,280
[Bingqiang]

601
00:23:32,590 --> 00:23:34,880
He became a warrior for Zhen.

602
00:23:34,880 --> 00:23:37,010
Zhen, how could you treat me like this?

603
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:39,800
For Zhen, Bingqiang was willing

604
00:23:39,960 --> 00:23:41,400
to become Chen Junnan's enemy.

605
00:23:41,400 --> 00:23:42,240
Zhen, run!

606
00:23:43,660 --> 00:23:46,950
[Village Convenience Store]

607
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:47,400
What's going on with Bingqiang?

608
00:23:48,200 --> 00:23:50,130
I think there's something going on

609
00:23:50,270 --> 00:23:51,720
between him and Zhen.

610
00:23:52,680 --> 00:23:53,740
He's not a good guy.

611
00:23:54,030 --> 00:23:55,480
Bingqiang is the best.

612
00:23:56,310 --> 00:23:59,270
He's gentle, considerate, and kind.

613
00:23:59,830 --> 00:24:02,200
If I were a woman,
I'd want to marry him.

614
00:24:03,680 --> 00:24:05,280
He's just a violent nutcase.

615
00:24:05,310 --> 00:24:05,920
Violent nutcase?

616
00:24:05,920 --> 00:24:07,720
He also has violent tendencies.

617
00:24:07,960 --> 00:24:08,960
Here, here, here.

618
00:24:09,350 --> 00:24:10,920
Look at this bald spot.

619
00:24:11,000 --> 00:24:12,070
Why did he hit you?

620
00:24:12,110 --> 00:24:12,790
He bullied me.

621
00:24:12,790 --> 00:24:13,720
He bullied you?

622
00:24:14,640 --> 00:24:16,400
Aren't you the village bully?

623
00:24:16,400 --> 00:24:18,310
Since when am I the village bully?

624
00:24:18,720 --> 00:24:20,520
I'm the most caring guy in Shapu.

625
00:24:24,680 --> 00:24:27,310
Then why did he leave the village?

626
00:24:27,310 --> 00:24:28,240
He was so good.

627
00:24:28,830 --> 00:24:30,550
With his smart brain,

628
00:24:30,960 --> 00:24:33,960
he got into a very good university

629
00:24:34,640 --> 00:24:36,240
and became the first

630
00:24:36,510 --> 00:24:38,200
good college student in our village.

631
00:24:38,200 --> 00:24:39,830
Then he got a very good job

632
00:24:40,550 --> 00:24:41,830
in a very good city.

633
00:24:42,030 --> 00:24:42,760
He's so good.

634
00:24:44,270 --> 00:24:45,030
He's so good.

635
00:24:45,510 --> 00:24:47,960
Then... if he's so amazing,

636
00:24:48,480 --> 00:24:49,610
why did he come back?

637
00:24:51,550 --> 00:24:52,720
I guess

638
00:24:53,750 --> 00:24:56,720
he came back looking
for a good life with someone.

639
00:24:58,350 --> 00:25:00,280
He has liked Zhen since he was a kid?

640
00:25:03,350 --> 00:25:05,210
This is Shapu's No. 1 guesthouse.

641
00:25:06,030 --> 00:25:07,200
So I guess the No. 1 guesthouse

642
00:25:07,200 --> 00:25:08,830
must be the best in Shapu.

643
00:25:09,350 --> 00:25:11,550
No, the best one is the No. 9 guesthouse.

644
00:25:12,110 --> 00:25:13,440
Then why am I staying...

645
00:25:14,350 --> 00:25:15,000
I get it.

646
00:25:16,000 --> 00:25:18,260
This guesthouse is closest to your home.

647
00:25:19,000 --> 00:25:19,510
No.

648
00:25:19,510 --> 00:25:20,400
I run it.

649
00:25:22,270 --> 00:25:24,200
Zhen, you're always the best to me.

650
00:25:26,550 --> 00:25:28,810
This is where you'll be staying tonight.

651
00:25:29,880 --> 00:25:31,340
I really have to thank you.

652
00:25:31,480 --> 00:25:32,810
Our house is unlivable.

653
00:25:32,960 --> 00:25:33,830
If it weren't for you,

654
00:25:33,830 --> 00:25:35,510
I'd be sleeping on the streets.

655
00:25:35,510 --> 00:25:37,510
Come on, we're practically family.

656
00:25:37,960 --> 00:25:39,160
But on my way here,

657
00:25:39,790 --> 00:25:42,480
I noticed Shapu Village has changed a lot.

658
00:25:42,680 --> 00:25:43,410
It's getting

659
00:25:43,750 --> 00:25:45,880
prettier and prettier, just like you.

660
00:25:45,960 --> 00:25:46,420
Really?

661
00:25:47,240 --> 00:25:47,900
Not really.

662
00:25:48,110 --> 00:25:49,350
We've both changed a lot.

663
00:25:49,350 --> 00:25:50,550
You've grown taller.

664
00:25:53,110 --> 00:25:54,350
Why did you come back

665
00:25:54,480 --> 00:25:55,350
this time?

666
00:25:56,200 --> 00:25:57,260
I came back for you.

667
00:25:59,880 --> 00:26:01,110
Just kidding.

668
00:26:03,590 --> 00:26:04,520
It's hilarious.

669
00:26:05,030 --> 00:26:06,240
My grandfather's death anniversary
is in a few days.

670
00:26:06,240 --> 00:26:07,900
I came back to pay my respects.

671
00:26:08,920 --> 00:26:09,520
I'm sorry.

672
00:26:10,750 --> 00:26:11,350
It's fine.

673
00:26:13,590 --> 00:26:14,310
A couple of days ago,

674
00:26:14,310 --> 00:26:15,750
I saw online that Shapu Village

675
00:26:15,750 --> 00:26:16,960
is becoming better and better.

676
00:26:16,960 --> 00:26:17,960
I'm very pleased.

677
00:26:19,640 --> 00:26:20,900
Recently, our village

678
00:26:20,960 --> 00:26:22,750
has been locked in a business battle
with Chuanao Village.

679
00:26:22,750 --> 00:26:25,590
It's already having quite an impact
on our local economy.

680
00:26:25,590 --> 00:26:28,450
Two small fishing villages
can have a business war?

681
00:26:29,750 --> 00:26:30,480
Don't worry.

682
00:26:32,550 --> 00:26:34,160
I studied international trade

683
00:26:34,160 --> 00:26:35,960
at Pierre and Marie Curie University

684
00:26:35,960 --> 00:26:38,070
in Paris, France.

685
00:26:38,400 --> 00:26:39,660
International trade.

686
00:26:39,720 --> 00:26:40,550
It's the perfect chance

687
00:26:40,550 --> 00:26:42,310
to contribute

688
00:26:42,350 --> 00:26:44,750
what I can to Shapu Village.

689
00:26:44,750 --> 00:26:45,350
Thank you.

690
00:26:46,200 --> 00:26:47,110
W-What is this?

691
00:26:47,830 --> 00:26:49,440
It's 150 yuan a night here.

692
00:26:49,790 --> 00:26:51,190
Don't you own this place?

693
00:26:52,270 --> 00:26:54,000
I run it with a friend.

694
00:26:54,440 --> 00:26:56,160
I don't have the final say.

695
00:26:57,240 --> 00:26:58,570
A-Are you staying long?

696
00:26:58,880 --> 00:27:00,340
If you stay for a long time,

697
00:27:01,000 --> 00:27:02,530
I'll give you a 1% discount.

698
00:27:03,960 --> 00:27:04,750
Zhen,

699
00:27:05,550 --> 00:27:06,750
you're the best to me.

700
00:27:08,440 --> 00:27:09,370
At least 10 days?

701
00:27:09,400 --> 00:27:10,070
15 days.

702
00:27:11,270 --> 00:27:12,000
Paid in full.

703
00:27:12,510 --> 00:27:13,270
Thank you, boss.

704
00:27:13,270 --> 00:27:14,240
May you get rich.

705
00:27:16,680 --> 00:27:17,030
Okay.

706
00:27:17,720 --> 00:27:18,310
Thank you.

707
00:27:18,310 --> 00:27:18,910
I've paid.

708
00:27:19,340 --> 00:27:22,000
Thank you
for your contribution to our village.

709
00:27:22,000 --> 00:27:22,880
Their family

710
00:27:23,790 --> 00:27:25,110
was driven out of the village.

711
00:27:25,110 --> 00:27:27,110
He used to live on the opposite hill.

712
00:27:27,550 --> 00:27:29,440
Their family started building a property
and left it unfinished,

713
00:27:29,440 --> 00:27:31,840
leaving the villagers in serious trouble.

714
00:27:38,160 --> 00:27:39,400
Calm down. Calm down.

715
00:27:39,480 --> 00:27:40,590
Listen to me, everyone.

716
00:27:40,590 --> 00:27:42,350
Chen Haisheng, you're suspected of fraud

717
00:27:42,350 --> 00:27:43,240
involving a substantial sum of money.

718
00:27:43,240 --> 00:27:44,110
Come with us now

719
00:27:44,160 --> 00:27:46,290
to cooperate with the investigation.

720
00:27:56,420 --> 00:28:00,100
[Shapu Cultural Tourism
Development Committee]

721
00:28:05,400 --> 00:28:06,310
Why is he here?

722
00:28:12,920 --> 00:28:14,440
Quiet, everyone, quiet.

723
00:28:14,720 --> 00:28:16,580
Let's have Jiahao say a few words.

724
00:28:18,040 --> 00:28:19,030
Go ahead, Jiahao.

725
00:28:19,030 --> 00:28:20,110
I don't hear any applause.

726
00:28:20,110 --> 00:28:20,480
Clap!

727
00:28:20,480 --> 00:28:20,960
Good.

728
00:28:21,000 --> 00:28:23,070
Good.

729
00:28:23,750 --> 00:28:25,680
Everyone here today

730
00:28:25,680 --> 00:28:28,680
is a leading business owner

731
00:28:29,110 --> 00:28:30,310
and the hope of Shapu.

732
00:28:31,160 --> 00:28:33,720
We've looked closely

733
00:28:33,750 --> 00:28:35,550
at how Chuanao Village operates

734
00:28:35,550 --> 00:28:36,950
and learned a few things.

735
00:28:37,030 --> 00:28:37,920
Chuanao

736
00:28:38,590 --> 00:28:40,110
has set up a chamber of commerce.

737
00:28:40,110 --> 00:28:40,480
So

738
00:28:41,550 --> 00:28:42,830
they can pool their efforts.

739
00:28:42,830 --> 00:28:44,270
That's why they're so impressive.

740
00:28:44,270 --> 00:28:45,110
So after

741
00:28:45,210 --> 00:28:46,160
discussions

742
00:28:46,830 --> 00:28:48,430
with our village committee,

743
00:28:48,830 --> 00:28:50,360
we've decided to establish

744
00:28:51,200 --> 00:28:52,200
the Shapu Village

745
00:28:52,960 --> 00:28:54,160
Cultural Tourism...

746
00:28:55,270 --> 00:28:57,670
Cultural Tourism Development Committee.

747
00:28:57,790 --> 00:28:58,520
We'll call it

748
00:28:59,030 --> 00:29:00,000
the "Shafa Committee" for short.

749
00:29:00,000 --> 00:29:02,480
Good!

750
00:29:03,510 --> 00:29:06,350
Next, as the acting chief,

751
00:29:06,550 --> 00:29:08,080
I will announce to everyone

752
00:29:08,200 --> 00:29:10,960
the leadership team
of our Shafa Committee.

753
00:29:13,000 --> 00:29:13,880
The President:

754
00:29:16,680 --> 00:29:17,510
Ms. Chen Jiazhen.

755
00:29:17,510 --> 00:29:18,270
Good!

756
00:29:22,640 --> 00:29:24,170
Just what everyone wanted.

757
00:29:24,640 --> 00:29:25,770
The Vice President:

758
00:29:25,960 --> 00:29:26,960
Mr. Chen Bingqiang.

759
00:29:26,960 --> 00:29:27,880
Good! Who?

760
00:29:30,480 --> 00:29:32,110
We object!. He's not qualified.

761
00:29:32,110 --> 00:29:33,200
Yes, I object, too.

762
00:29:38,110 --> 00:29:39,830
Quiet. Quiet!

763
00:29:42,640 --> 00:29:43,550
Quiet.

764
00:29:44,200 --> 00:29:45,660
Everyone, sit down first.

765
00:29:46,640 --> 00:29:48,770
I-I understand how you feel right now.

766
00:29:49,350 --> 00:29:51,960
After all, Bingqiang's father
swindled us all,

767
00:29:51,960 --> 00:29:54,350
and we paid dearly for it.

768
00:29:55,160 --> 00:29:57,090
But here's what I want to say today.

769
00:29:57,310 --> 00:29:58,510
A father is one thing,

770
00:29:58,590 --> 00:29:59,720
and a son is another.

771
00:29:59,830 --> 00:30:01,270
You can't hold the son responsible
for the father's actions.

772
00:30:01,270 --> 00:30:04,030
History has taught us this

773
00:30:04,030 --> 00:30:04,890
time and again.

774
00:30:06,000 --> 00:30:06,530
Yang Kang

775
00:30:06,550 --> 00:30:07,350
was a villain,

776
00:30:07,720 --> 00:30:08,750
but Yang Guo was a hero

777
00:30:08,750 --> 00:30:09,880
who fought the Jin.

778
00:30:10,350 --> 00:30:11,920
He protected Xiangyang many times.

779
00:30:11,920 --> 00:30:13,160
Aren't those just fictional characters?

780
00:30:13,160 --> 00:30:14,070
And Wolffy

781
00:30:14,380 --> 00:30:15,770
is a big bad wolf.

782
00:30:16,480 --> 00:30:18,010
But his son, Little Wolffy,

783
00:30:18,070 --> 00:30:19,000
never eats sheep

784
00:30:19,310 --> 00:30:21,110
and even protected the Goat Village.

785
00:30:21,110 --> 00:30:23,110
What on earth are you talking about?

786
00:30:24,440 --> 00:30:25,520
You all know Nezha,

787
00:30:25,550 --> 00:30:26,880
the demon child, right?

788
00:30:27,070 --> 00:30:28,440
My fate is in my own hands, not heaven's.

789
00:30:28,440 --> 00:30:29,970
He defended Chentang Pass.

790
00:30:30,070 --> 00:30:32,400
Though he and his dad
didn't exactly get along...

791
00:30:32,400 --> 00:30:34,310
Of course, his dad was always
using that pagoda to keep him in line.

792
00:30:34,310 --> 00:30:35,240
Jiahao. Jiahao.

793
00:30:35,350 --> 00:30:36,350
The two of them...

794
00:30:36,400 --> 00:30:37,030
Jiahao.

795
00:30:37,070 --> 00:30:38,930
How about I say a few words myself?

796
00:30:41,200 --> 00:30:41,830
Okay, then

797
00:30:42,550 --> 00:30:44,080
you can speak for yourself.

798
00:30:47,270 --> 00:30:48,550
Fellow villagers,

799
00:30:49,680 --> 00:30:50,750
do you hate my father?

800
00:30:50,750 --> 00:30:51,720
Yes!

801
00:30:55,590 --> 00:30:56,320
He's a fraud.

802
00:30:56,640 --> 00:30:57,200
What do you think?

803
00:30:57,200 --> 00:30:57,680
Yes.

804
00:30:57,780 --> 00:30:58,480
I know.

805
00:30:59,510 --> 00:31:01,320
But all of your hatred combined

806
00:31:01,350 --> 00:31:03,900
is not even a ten-thousandth
of my hatred for him.

807
00:31:03,900 --> 00:31:05,560
Oh, come on. Keep pretending.

808
00:31:05,640 --> 00:31:06,680
I was young then

809
00:31:06,960 --> 00:31:08,690
and didn't know what happened.

810
00:31:09,400 --> 00:31:10,860
When I found out the truth,

811
00:31:11,200 --> 00:31:13,790
I immediately cut my ties with him

812
00:31:13,790 --> 00:31:16,200
and sent him to prison.

813
00:31:18,030 --> 00:31:18,720
Is it true?

814
00:31:21,640 --> 00:31:23,570
I didn't know how to face everyone.

815
00:31:23,640 --> 00:31:25,480
Placing righteousness
above family loyalty.

816
00:31:25,480 --> 00:31:26,280
I went abroad.

817
00:31:26,680 --> 00:31:27,880
Until I saw on the internet

818
00:31:27,880 --> 00:31:29,270
that Shapu Village needs development

819
00:31:29,270 --> 00:31:30,430
and talent.

820
00:31:31,000 --> 00:31:31,920
I made the difficult decision

821
00:31:31,920 --> 00:31:34,790
to give up a hard-won job abroad

822
00:31:34,830 --> 00:31:37,110
and came all the way back
to China on my own

823
00:31:38,240 --> 00:31:39,300
just for the chance

824
00:31:40,030 --> 00:31:42,630
to give something back
to my fellow villagers.

825
00:31:48,270 --> 00:31:48,960
I know

826
00:31:49,920 --> 00:31:51,480
my father is a jerk.

827
00:31:52,960 --> 00:31:53,790
But I am not.

828
00:31:55,240 --> 00:31:57,700
I hope everyone
will give me another chance.

829
00:31:57,960 --> 00:32:01,270
I want to be Shapu's own Yang Guo,

830
00:32:02,310 --> 00:32:03,000
Nezha,

831
00:32:05,270 --> 00:32:06,270
or Little Wolffy.

832
00:32:12,650 --> 00:32:13,610
He is a good boy.

833
00:32:14,960 --> 00:32:15,680
Please.

834
00:32:22,550 --> 00:32:23,640
Good.

835
00:32:23,640 --> 00:32:24,680
I believe you.

836
00:32:24,680 --> 00:32:26,920
Okay.

837
00:32:32,160 --> 00:32:33,020
Deeply moving.

838
00:32:33,510 --> 00:32:35,790
I hope everyone can put
their prejudices aside for now

839
00:32:35,790 --> 00:32:37,030
and give Bingqiang

840
00:32:37,050 --> 00:32:39,180
a chance to build our beautiful Shapu.

841
00:32:40,880 --> 00:32:42,540
Let's continue with the list.

842
00:32:43,310 --> 00:32:44,030
Members:

843
00:32:44,640 --> 00:32:45,480
Mr. Zhou Ke.

844
00:32:46,000 --> 00:32:47,790
Good.

845
00:32:48,110 --> 00:32:49,480
Congratulations, Mr. Zhou.

846
00:32:49,480 --> 00:32:50,110
Good.

847
00:32:50,110 --> 00:32:50,880
I believe you.

848
00:32:50,880 --> 00:32:51,510
Good.

849
00:32:51,750 --> 00:32:52,510
Ms. Zuxian.

850
00:32:52,510 --> 00:32:53,960
Good.

851
00:32:53,980 --> 00:32:55,010
Mr. Weiting.

852
00:32:55,360 --> 00:32:56,400
Mr. Yixun.

853
